\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The three-stage curriculum. Each stage adds one source of difficulty and inherits the weights of the stage before it: representation warm-up over labelled source data with the trunk frozen; cross-lingual alignment, which unfreezes the trunk and introduces the gradient-reversed language discriminator over unlabelled target audio; and dual-adversarial hardening, which adds adaptive FGSM/PGD sampling on top of the aligned representation.}}{7}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:training}{{3}{7}{The three-stage curriculum. Each stage adds one source of difficulty and inherits the weights of the stage before it: representation warm-up over labelled source data with the trunk frozen; cross-lingual alignment, which unfreezes the trunk and introduces the gradient-reversed language discriminator over unlabelled target audio; and dual-adversarial hardening, which adds adaptive FGSM/PGD sampling on top of the aligned representation}{figure.3}{}}
